+## Pure Thinglish serialization — `src/thinglish/` (Tron, 2026-10-02) — specified, not built
+
+Every component's `src/` gains a **`thinglish/`** folder beside `ts/`, `js/`, `thinglish.ts/`, `thinglish.js/`, `puml/`, `mmd/`: the model **serialized in pure Thinglish** — the grammar above — one type per file, **`src/thinglish/EAM/<layer>/<Name>.class.thing`** or **`<Name>.interface.thing`** (by kind, like convention 4). Rendered by a new M2 target **`M2ThingClass`** from the **model** (never parsed from source), so it is generated and committed like every target.
+
+- **TH1 one file per type, derived:** every catalogued class has exactly one `.thing` file of the right kind in its component's `src/thinglish/EAM/<layer>/`; the expected set is derived from the catalog (CHECKED / SKIPPED / TOTAL, SKIPPED 0); seed a missing or wrong-kind file → RED.
+- **TH2 generated from the model:** `npm start` reproduces every `.thing` with zero diff; seed a hand-edit → RED.
+- **TH3 lossless:** every declarative fact of the model appears — namespace, dependencies, kind, type params, extends/implements, attributes (type, initializer, modifiers), properties, methods (params, return type, modifiers, TypeScript body or `;`), relationships/collections (multiplicity by keyword, `redefines`); seed: drop any one of them from the renderer → RED by name.
+- **TH4 only grammar keywords:** every keyword used in any `.thing` belongs to the keyword set **derived from `ThinglishGrammar`**; every keyword maps per SC8 (to an M3 element, an instance of `Namespace`/`Version`, or — modifiers — an attribute of an M3 element).
+- **TH5 no invention:** a model field the grammar cannot express is **reported**, never rendered in made-up syntax and never silently dropped.
+- Parsing `.thing` back into the model (`ThinglishParser`, F6) is **not** in scope; these files are its input.
+
+**Increments:** **A (atomic, one push):** grammar amendment = this spec's EBNF + keyword rows + `ThinglishGrammar` model (EBNF of record + modifier mappings) + oopTester's SC8 extension. **B:** `M2ThingClass` + `src/thinglish/` for every component + TH1–TH5.
